# Internal design docs. Keep the latest PixelFlow agent/skill flow design tracked
# because future agent-flow changes must update it together with code.
docs/*
!docs/
!docs/pixelflow-agent-skill-flow-latest-design.md
!docs/PixelFlow完整Agent化改造方案与并行实施计划.docx
!docs/agentization/
!docs/agentization/**

# IntelliJ IDEA / PyCharm local project metadata.
.idea/

# Local DeerFlow/Pixelflow runtime data.
.deer-flow/

# Local Codex helper logs.
**/.codex-*.log

# 用途：忽略 Python 解释器生成的字节码缓存；影响：本地测试不会污染 Git 工作区。
**/__pycache__/

.claude/

.understand-anything/

# 用途：隔离 Codex 模块 worktree；影响：本地模块检出不会进入仓库暂存范围。
.worktrees/
